---
title: Penicillin
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, scotch]
source: Classic cocktail, number 20 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @blended Scotch{2%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{0.75%fl_oz} and @honey-ginger syrup{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #rocks glass{}(with ice). Float @Islay Scotch{0.25%fl_oz} on top by pouring it over the back of a bar spoon.

> Created by Sam Ross at Milk & Honey, New York, in 2005. The smoky float should sit on top, so don't stir.
